- "Has anyone else had a similar situation and was there anything you did you help your child walk with straight feet?" [ar035-0131]
- "He doesn't want to do anything on his own - I have to push him to try to do things (I.e., pick up and eat his own sandwich, wipe his hands, take his own shoes off, etc.) It's usually, "Mama do it!"" [ar077-0142]
