- "My 2 year old, for the last few weeks has been regularly telling us he's tired, and then acting like he wants to sleep (getting his comforter, laying down on the couch) he doesnt actually go to sleep, and usually gets distracted out of it after a little while. This can be at times where its pretty unreasonable for him to be tired." [ar084-0056]
- "They described the event: she was sitting painting and randomly stood up and started convulsing, she dropped her paintbrush and was not alert did not respond to her name, this lasted about a minute. After about a minute per her teacher she sat back down and continued to paint as if nothing happened. Her teacher mentioned it resembled a child in her class that had seizures." [ar016-0066]
- "My son is about to turn 3 and this week he has been doing this movement with his eyes, like winking but it’s hard winking on one eye (sometimes right eye, sometimes left). The last 2 days he did it a lot more than usual, probably every 5 seconds, and it got me so worried. He doesn’t really do screen time, if so it’s very minimal." [ar038-0167]
