- "Yesterday she brought me a piece that had fallen off her play kitchen and said “What’s this?” and it occurred to me that this was the first time she’s asked that kind of question. Then I gave it more thought and realized she’s not asking a lot of questions in general. She clearly tells us what she wants/needs/observes but doesn’t ask questions." [ar044-0065]
