- "In many ways he is such a sweet, funny, outspoken, smart and wonderfully original little boy, and I love him with every inch of my being. But I’m tired. I feel like I’ve spent the last 3.5 years trying to understand him, protecting him and reassuring myself and others that it will pass." [ar041-0121]
- "She started trying to bite me and I told her I had to leave the room to keep my body safe. When I left the room and looked on her camera, she was banging her head on the wall and screaming. I ran into her room to stop it. She’s finally napping but I am so rattled and scared. Is this in any way normal behavior?" [ar029-0069]
