**But:** The interactions are not all described as threatening: the parent of the outgoing toddler says most people simply smile and continue walking. "Most people just smile and walk on, but some tend to stop and start chatting to her or encourage her to give them a hug (i dont want her hugging strangers)." [ar070-0045]

